node_modules/

# Ignore everything under dist/ except the placeholder index.html that
# ships in the repo so //go:embed compiles before the frontend has ever
# been built. `dist/*` (with the trailing star) is required: a bare
# `dist/` ignores the directory entry itself, which would also re-ignore
# `dist/index.html` regardless of the negation rule below.
dist/*
!dist/index.html

# Wails generates JS shims for the Go bindings here on `wails build` / `wails dev`.
# We ignore the generated Go-app bindings (they're regenerated per build) but
# TRACK the Wails runtime library itself — it's a stable Wails-shipped file
# imported by Palette.svelte / Sidebar.svelte via `EventsOn`, and CI uses
# `-skipbindings` (the generator hangs on Windows runners), so without
# committing the runtime the vite/rollup build would fail to resolve the
# import. The runtime is small (~300 LoC, MIT-licensed by Wails).
src/wailsjs/wailsjs/go/
src/wailsjs/wailsjs/runtime/*.map

# Vite cache
.vite/
